<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0692_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Doug</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We should swap numbers, so I can school\nyou on the GREATNESS of Bug-type\fhomies! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You betcha. Good looks!\nI’ll call you sometime!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t say such sad stuff...\nMy beetle heard you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you decide to swap\nnumbers after all? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, there you!\rI was finna give you a Berry, so I been\nwaitin’ here for you!\fFor four hours. With the bugs.\rHere you go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wait, what?\rIf you right nearby, don’t bother with\nthe phone. Come talk in person!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} growin’ up good, if I do\nsay so myself!\rIn a scrap against {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, it knocked\nit out before I could BLINK!\fI blink slow. But still!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Argh, I give up! My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} got\npretty strong, you know.\rI figured it could knock out a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} easy...\rBut it was HELLA high level...\nWe got beat up, down, AND sideways...\fMostly sideways.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Earlier by the road, a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} jumped\nout at me!\rI LOVE homies, but... BAM!\nIt scared me!\rIf you gon’ jump out at a person,\nintroduce yourself FIRST! Manners!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d deadass like to sit down and\ntalk with you about how great\fBug-type homies is!\rWhat you think? I’m on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. How ’bout you come\fover for a scrap?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Let’s scrap. We ain’t had one\nin a minute! I’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}...\fDon’t forget!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, my pops was a researcher\nstudyin’ Bug-type homies.\rEver since I was lil, there’s always\nbeen Bug types ALL over the crib.\rThat’s why I love Bug types.\rMy mom...\nWell, she screamed a LOT.\fShe lives in a hotel now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I found some Berries. I already got\nmore than I need, so here’s some!\rI’m on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Come grab\n’em!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0692_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You want Berries, don’t you?\rI’ll give you some if you come see me\non {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
</body>
